        { "@type": "Question", "name": "What measurements do I need to use this calculator?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "You need three measurements: bust or chest, waist, and hip, all in the same unit (inches or centimetres). High hip is optional and adds a bonus ratio. Age, height and weight are optional extras that unlock BMI and an age-context note in your result." } },
